<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz to issue convertible bonds.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz to issue convertible bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektromontaz Export SA plans a convertible bond and share issue, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and said the issue would be voted on at a general shareholders meeting on October 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
